        "content": "Should I pack an umbrella for Montmartre, then?"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "No: it stays sunny."
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "And for the jazz club?"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Bring a light jacket: May nights fall to 12°C, and the walk back from a club in Saint-Germain to the hotel near the Louvre is a long one."
